    "description": "You loved playing King\u2019s match 3 puzzle game Candy Crush Saga - start playing Candy Crush Soda Saga! Enjoy even more delicious matching combinations, match 3 games, and challenging game modes, all brimming with purple soda and sweet fun!\r\n\r\nThis mouth-watering puzzle game and adventure will instantly quench your thirst for fun and give you a sugar rush. Match 3 candies and blast your way through new dimensions of candy-filled gameplay. Take on this sweet soda Saga alone or play with friends to see who can become the soda pop master!\r\n\r\nMonthly season updates bring unique new levels and exciting match 3 puzzles - more candy to blast means more fun to have! Progress through the Season Pass while earning rewards and sweet jelly boosters to help you on your Saga.\r\n\r\nCompete against other players to see who can master levels the fastest, or work as a team in the 4 in a Row game mode, where players collaborate for Sodalicious rewards!\r\n\r\nA SUGARY MATCH 3 PUZZLE GAME\r\nMatch to Win: Match 3 candies to get the highest score!\r\nSolve puzzles against friends or as a team.\r\nOver 10,000 Sodalicious match three puzzle games online and offline\r\nMouth-watering graphics, with sweet 3D characters and an ever-changing environment\r\n\r\nDIFFERENT SWEET MATCHING GAME MODES:\r\nSoda: Switch the bottles and match 3 or more candies to release purple soda\r\nFrosting: Match candies to blast the ice\r\nHoneycomb: Match 3 candies or more next to honeycomb to release the trapped Candy Bears\r\nJam: Spread the jam to clear the board\r\n\r\nNEW CANDYLICIOUS COMBINATIONS:\r\nMatch 4 candies in a square block to make a Swedish Fish!\r\nMatch 7 candies for the all-new Coloring Candy!\r\n\r\nSODA POP FUN AND STRATEGY IN EVERY MOVE:\r\nEnjoy the mania of matching candies and master sweet levels!\r\nUse strategy to make the best matches and blast through levels faster.\r\n\r\nSUGAR-SWEET FEATURES:\r\nPop candies to create powerful sugary boosters!\r\nBlast challenging block obstacles and clear your way to new levels.\r\nLearn zen by solving fun puzzles.\r\nTriple your fun with unique combo moves and power-ups.\r\nEngage in the ultimate match 3 mania and master the puzzles.\r\n\r\nHave fun playing the fizziest soda match 3 puzzle game around!\r\n\r\nIf you enjoy playing and want to master and blast even more sugar puzzles, you may also enjoy the match 3 games Candy Crush Jelly Saga and Candy Crush Friends Saga!\r\n\r\nCandy Crush Soda Saga is free to play, but optional in-game items such as extra moves or lives require payment. You can turn off the payment feature by disabling in-app purchases in your device\u2019s settings.\r\n\r\nBy downloading Candy Crush Soda Saga you agree to our terms of service, which can be found at https://king.com/termsAndConditions.\r\n\r\nDo not sell my data: King shares your personal information with advertising partners to personalize ads. Learn more at https://king.com/privacyPolicy. If you wish to exercise your Do Not Sell My Data rights, you can do so by contacting us via the in-game help center or by going to https://soporto.king.com/contact.",
